<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's singles results on the eighth</p>
<p>day of the French Open tennis tournament on Monday:</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding.</p>
<p>* denotes new results</p>
<p>Fourth round:</p>
<p>*Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) 5-7</p>
<p>6-1 6-2 1-6 7-5</p>
</text>
